! Small OpenDSS model with every GAD device type, used by the GAD converter tests.
! 3-phase 4.16 kV feeder: src -(3-ph reg)- n1 -(3 x 1-ph regs)- n2 -- n3 -- n4
!   n3: 2 PVSystems, 3-ph capacitor + CapControl, 2 loads on phase a (different
!       shapes), 1 fixed load on phase b
!   n4: Generator (phase a), Storage, off single-phase capacitor, 3-ph load,
!       1-element delta load (phases b-c)
! Loadshapes have 96 hourly points; every device has yearly, daily and duty shapes.

Clear

New Circuit.gad_devices basekv=4.16 pu=1.0 phases=3 bus1=src MVAsc3=20000 MVASC1=21000

